    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73063a1dfe127778bfea675",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰的神情比以往都还认真。\n她经历过原本只是抽象目标的顶尖舞台后，\n想实现梦想的心情似乎变得更强烈了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c074801b5e1d264ea564e6dda0ff33d0eb1f0a6b258fbc898735d6001b692e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046306.json",
      "json_path": [
