      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以她现在的实力，\n就算要参加强者云集的GⅠ也毫无问题。\n既然如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7417faee1ca633946ab6ea5126520c21a0c5aca5ac17608e40f080fc66ac2a54",
